# Security

- Input untrusted; doğrulama server-side (`validation.mdc`). Client guard güvenlik sayılmaz
- Least privilege; ownership / tenant / cookie / S3 detayı → `api.mdc`
- Secret/token/password hardcode veya git’e koyma; sensitive log/response yok
- SQL: parameterized/ORM. XSS/CSRF bağlama göre; CORS prod’da `*` yok
- Abuse: rate limit (`redis.mdc`); auth fail → deny
- Custom crypto / home-grown auth yok — bcrypt, PyJWT, mevcut akış
- Dependency: `supply-chain.mdc`
